# My Favourite Rainbows

I love rainbows! They appear after the rain, when the sun peeks out from behind the clouds.

My favourite rainbow was one I saw last summer. I was playing in the garden when the rain stopped. Suddenly, a huge rainbow stretched across the sky. It was so big and bright!

The colours were amazing. Red, orange, yellow, green, blue, indigo and violet. They looked like a giant paintbrush had swept across the sky.

I ran to tell Mum. "Quick! Come and see!" We stood together on the grass, looking up. The rainbow seemed to touch the trees at the end of our garden.

"Maybe there's a pot of gold there," Mum said with a smile.

I like rainbows best when they are double rainbows. Two rainbows at once! One is always fainter than the other, like a shy friend hiding behind.

Rainbows make me feel happy and calm. They remind me that sunny days always come back after the rain.

Next time it rains, I shall watch the sky carefully. Perhaps another beautiful rainbow will appear, just for me. [end of text]


